`api/invoices/[id].ts:18` loads the invoice by id and never checks it belongs to the caller's account. Any signed-in user can read every invoice by counting up ids.

```ts
const invoice = await db.invoice.findUnique({ where: { id } })
return json(invoice)
```

The fix scopes the query to `session.accountId` and returns 404 otherwise, plus a test.
